                                "sense_id": "92d145b1-d96c-3b2c-a791-c3c4f18c4489",
                                "text": "THE Scepticks think 'twas long ago, / Since Gods came down Incognito; / To ſee who were their Friends or Foes, / And how our Actions fell or roſe."
